From 3cd272942587a6aa03cffa3f9cfbdad1aff93480 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 09:17:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ADD strict selected-agent slash routing so backend
 commands bypass prompt turns

Selected-agent messages whose first token is slash dispatch through the provider command hook instead of the normal prompt send path, so provider commands can run without starting a model turn.

The controller runs these commands immediately for busy chats, and the Codex backend preserves coherent thread state when launch completion and command actions such as fork both touch the active app-server thread id.
